{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Skull Hotel",
    "steam_appid": 3739730,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739730/extras/87269f90d8cc0d795b097d079bd9e0c7.poster.avif?t=1752596333\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739730/extras/87269f90d8cc0d795b097d079bd9e0c7.webm?t=1752596333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Horror Experience</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience realistic graphics and a chilling horror soundscape that intensifies as you progress. Every detail is designed to keep you on edge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739730/extras/a7b4e3bab5b416aa12bbf32a62c30b9f.poster.avif?t=1752596333\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739730/extras/a7b4e3bab5b416aa12bbf32a62c30b9f.webm?t=1752596333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unpredictable Danger</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a variety of original horror mechanics and dozens of hiding spots, you never know where the next threat will come from. Each playthrough is unique, making every cleaning shift a new experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739730/extras/d5dd2042bc0fa6375bf19e8342376070.poster.avif?t=1752596333\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739730/extras/d5dd2042bc0fa6375bf19e8342376070.webm?t=1752596333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><br>Easy to Learn, Hard to Master</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skull Hotel is easy to pick up and play and can be finished in under 10 minutes, but its psychological horror and unpredictable gameplay make it truly difficult to complete. Expect to die multiple times before finishing the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739730/extras/c38c004cd09f36bfb022b4562d0db918.poster.avif?t=1752596333\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739730/extras/c38c004cd09f36bfb022b4562d0db918.webm?t=1752596333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><br>Leave Your Mark</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive your shift and sign the guest book at the reception to prove you made it. Will your name be remembered, or will you become just another lost guest?</p> ",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739730/extras/87269f90d8cc0d795b097d079bd9e0c7.poster.avif?t=1752596333\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739730/extras/87269f90d8cc0d795b097d079bd9e0c7.webm?t=1752596333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Horror Experience</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience realistic graphics and a chilling horror soundscape that intensifies as you progress. Every detail is designed to keep you on edge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739730/extras/a7b4e3bab5b416aa12bbf32a62c30b9f.poster.avif?t=1752596333\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739730/extras/a7b4e3bab5b416aa12bbf32a62c30b9f.webm?t=1752596333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unpredictable Danger</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a variety of original horror mechanics and dozens of hiding spots, you never know where the next threat will come from. Each playthrough is unique, making every cleaning shift a new experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739730/extras/d5dd2042bc0fa6375bf19e8342376070.poster.avif?t=1752596333\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739730/extras/d5dd2042bc0fa6375bf19e8342376070.webm?t=1752596333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><br>Easy to Learn, Hard to Master</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skull Hotel is easy to pick up and play and can be finished in under 10 minutes, but its psychological horror and unpredictable gameplay make it truly difficult to complete. Expect to die multiple times before finishing the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739730/extras/c38c004cd09f36bfb022b4562d0db918.poster.avif?t=1752596333\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739730/extras/c38c004cd09f36bfb022b4562d0db918.webm?t=1752596333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><br>Leave Your Mark</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive your shift and sign the guest book at the reception to prove you made it. Will your name be remembered, or will you become just another lost guest?</p> ",
    "short_description": "Skull Hotel is a horror game where you clean hotel rooms while creatures hide, waiting to kill you.",
